1
00:00:00,875 --> 00:00:04,791
"It's summer here," I am unwavering

2
00:00:04,791 --> 00:00:08,166
I wonder who shakes me up now?

3
00:00:08,166 --> 00:00:13,416
I felt like you brushed my cheek, Professor Wind

4
00:00:13,416 --> 00:00:19,125
I think of you, glowing crimson

5
00:00:30,041 --> 00:00:35,250
Just calling your name makes my heart ache

6
00:00:35,250 --> 00:00:37,291
Raindrops begin to tremble

7
00:00:37,291 --> 00:00:42,416
Waiting for you, the wind blows

8
00:00:42,416 --> 00:00:47,083
The world crumbles away

9
00:00:51,875 --> 00:00:57,041
Even when I'm freezing, I'm always wearing

10
00:00:57,041 --> 00:00:59,000
The temperature of that day

11
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:04,333
When your rain falls, I dance

12
00:01:04,333 --> 00:01:06,375
And come back to life

13
00:01:06,375 --> 00:01:07,666
The two of us first met

14
00:01:07,666 --> 00:01:13,458
I saw you off to the east and turned to the moon

15
00:01:13,458 --> 00:01:22,708
This way, I'm sure time will slow down

16
00:01:22,708 --> 00:01:26,541
"It's summer here," I am unwavering

17
00:01:26,541 --> 00:01:30,041
I wonder who shakes me up now?

18
00:01:30,041 --> 00:01:35,291
I felt like you brushed my cheek, Professor Wind

19
00:01:35,291 --> 00:01:39,791
I think of you, glowing crimson

20
00:01:51,750 --> 00:01:53,375
That day kept replaying

21
00:01:53,375 --> 00:01:55,458
How do you like the meadow's scent?

22
00:01:55,458 --> 00:01:57,083
Knowing it means to wither with each step,

23
00:01:57,083 --> 00:01:58,875
I dove into the wind

24
00:01:58,875 --> 00:02:00,666
It's a reckless affection

25
00:02:00,666 --> 00:02:02,708
You're not the kind to look back

26
00:02:02,708 --> 00:02:04,583
No matter how hard I wave

27
00:02:04,583 --> 00:02:06,333
No matter how hard I wave, friend

28
00:02:06,333 --> 00:02:10,083
No matter how I try to stay away

29
00:02:10,083 --> 00:02:11,333
The two of us meet

30
00:02:11,333 --> 00:02:17,041
I set it so that the air would turn sweet

31
00:02:17,041 --> 00:02:26,375
This way, my pulse will slow down in August

32
00:02:26,375 --> 00:02:30,166
"It's summer here," I am unwavering

33
00:02:30,166 --> 00:02:33,666
I wonder who shakes me up now?

34
00:02:33,666 --> 00:02:38,916
I felt like you brushed my cheek, Professor Wind

35
00:02:38,916 --> 00:02:40,875
Don't fade away yet

36
00:02:40,958 --> 00:02:44,416
"It's summer here," to you who are unwavering

37
00:02:44,416 --> 00:02:48,166
It's all right if you are shaken because of me

38
00:02:48,166 --> 00:02:53,375
I can't reach you no matter how I try, Professor Wind

39
00:02:53,375 --> 00:02:58,083
I think of you, glowing crimson

40
00:03:02,750 --> 00:03:09,958
On the path between rice fields, go down, down, down

41
00:03:09,958 --> 00:03:17,375
Each season out of sync, cross over, over, over to you
